  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "梅菲斯特？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你沒有拒絕的理由吧？一些不小心飛進來的小蟲子......值得你親自追擊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我的部隊已經接到了你的情報，你已經盡到了你的責任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "接下來，請你回去吧。畢竟你負責的是核心能源區及其外圍......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "少做多餘的事......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你還有其他事情要做，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "好。隨便你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "我已經等不及要觀賞你的慘敗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "收隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......敵人的頭目......帶著一部分整合運動的部隊，撤離了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "這小子，在做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "不能放鬆警惕......敵人的數量，依然是我們的數倍之多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唉唉，弑君者的口氣一直不是很禮貌，請允許我代她道歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你們可以稱呼我，梅菲斯特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "你們整合運動，究竟要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "也沒什麼。其實，放你們離開也無所謂。畢竟剛開始，你們也不算是整合運動的目標。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "既然我們不是整合運動的目標，那為什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "不過，我有幸觀賞了你們的戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你們的作戰方式和你們的人員配置，很有趣哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "......有趣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "說戰場的廝殺......有趣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "羅德島......我看過你們的資料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "原本，我只把你們當作是普通企業。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "現在看來，你們所涉獵的，可遠遠超出了擺弄試管的範疇哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "要是讓你們輕輕鬆鬆地離開，就沒什麼意思了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我想和各位，來一場祭祀式的競賽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "......我們沒工夫和心智不全的小孩子浪費時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "（阿米婭，準備好，我們可能要強行突圍了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "（我來吸引他的注意力......！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（啊，嗯！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "......剛剛那是什麼？你是向誰，打了什麼訊號嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "與你無關，小子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "（阿米婭？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "哎呀，都是些企業人士了，連談話時要注意禮節這個道理，都不明白嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "就是因為這世界上像你這樣的人越來越多，才導致我不得不多學些能夠形容你們的詞彙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "（阿米婭，發生什麼了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（杜賓......我們的撤退路線，都被他的部隊封鎖了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "（怎麼會！短短幾分鐘內，他——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這樣不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我誠心誠意地邀請你們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你們卻只想著——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "——逃之夭夭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "呿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "其實，只要你們贏了，就可以安全地離開我的獵場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "接下來，我的這些朋友們，會不斷地嘗試殺掉你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你們只要活下來，就是勝利！怎麼樣，規則，很簡單吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "Ace！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "已經做好了強行突圍的準備！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "但我們要先扛過這次圍攻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "為什麼，明明天災就要來了！再不撤出切城，所有人都會——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你在說什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "正因為是天災降臨......這可是，一個最該被好好慶祝的時刻了呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我高貴的客人們，能邀請你們參加遊戲，我感到十分榮幸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "啊......啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "殺......殺！！殺了......他們！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "阿米婭！小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "對了，對了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "其實，我們是知道你們在核心區裡做了什麼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那個你們從核心區裡救出來的，一直遮住臉龐的傢伙......令人非常，非常在意呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "——？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "弑君者只關心你們之後要做什麼，要去哪裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我不一樣。我只關心......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你，是什麼？從哪裡來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "對，你，就是現在，盯著我看的你......你和我們有點不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那個設施裡，究竟是什麼裝置，有著保存生命的功能呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我非常，非常好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我也不是那種冷血的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "來吧，羅德島的客人們，把這個傢伙當成見面禮留給我吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那樣的話，雖然令人惋惜，但我放你們離開，也是可以的哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "博士——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "——退到我身後！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
